      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRILLIANT BLUE (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (16.71) in a Grade 5 at Q Straight over 300m. Has ability and looks hard to stop. AVOID THE NOISE (4) is better than last start when fourth (19.81) in a OPEN at Capalaba over 366m. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Key runner on best form. SPRING HALLIE (7) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 4.5 lengths into second (19.77) at this track in a Grade 5 over 352m. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Expecting another good run. RADLEY (2) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
